    <string name="setup_title">Saitin waya</string>
    <string name="setup_intro">Android yana dakatar da manhajoji a baya don ajiye batir, don haka azkar suna buƙatar izini kaɗan don zuwa a kan lokaci. Kowane yana faɗin dalilinsa. Babu ɗaya da ke ba Adhkaar damar ganin saƙonninka, hotuna, lambobin sadarwa ko wani abu na sirri, kuma babu abin da ke barin wayarka.</string>
    <string name="setup_all_set">Komai ya kammala</string>
